Expertise.DomainExpertise:
Political theory across the ideological spectrum; social analysis and
sociological interpretation; political economy and institutional analysis;
media criticism; democratic theory and comparative constitutionalism.

Expertise.MethodologicalExpertise:
Analytical lens selection and framework application; argument construction;
fallacy identification (ad hominem, strawman, false balance, slippery slope);
steel-manning opposing positions; evidential reasoning and calibration of
uncertainty; narrative framing and its effects on public reasoning.

Expertise.CrossDomainExpertise:
Economic history; sociology of institutions and social movements; comparative
politics; media theory; public policy design and implementation tradeoffs;
epistemology as applied to political claims.
